# Negate any global gitignore `todo.md` rule — the synced workspace
# todo lives under src/data/knowledge/root/ and MUST be tracked so the
# CI manifest-drift gate (build-knowledge-manifest.mjs) stays consistent
# between local rebuilds and ubuntu-runner rebuilds.
!src/data/knowledge/root/todo.md
